NOTE on data sources:

This MIT license covers ONLY the source code in this repository. The pipeline
fetches data from third-party sources at runtime, each with their own license
terms:

  * Kartverket / GeoNorge (WFS postnummer + Matrikkelen-Bygningspunkt):
      Norsk lisens for offentlige data (NLOD) 2.0
      https://data.norge.no/nlod/no/2.0

  * Bring postnummer-registry:
      Free use with attribution to Bring as source
      https://www.bring.no/tjenester/adressetjenester/postnummer

  * Statistisk sentralbyrå (tabeller 03013, 05940, 06035, 06070, 06265,
    06266, 06513, 06913, 07984, 09429, 09588, 10540, 10748, 12558, 14674):
      Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY 4.0) / NLOD 2.0
      https://www.ssb.no/

  * Norges Bank (styringsrente via åpen statistikk-API):
      Norsk lisens for offentlige data (NLOD) 2.0
      https://data.norges-bank.no/

  * Entur (nasjonalt stoppestedregister via Journey Planner GraphQL):
      Norsk lisens for offentlige data (NLOD) 2.0
      https://developer.entur.org/

  * Meteorologisk institutt (klima-normaler 1991-2020 for Oslo/Blindern,
    Bergen/Florida, Trondheim/Voll, Stavanger/Sola, Tromsø, Kristiansand/Kjevik):
      Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY 4.0)
      https://www.met.no/

When redistributing data fetched by this pipeline, you must comply with the
license terms of the respective source and provide proper attribution.
